> Interpretation and limits

Malformed strides are rejected instead of permitting negative or overflowing
indices. Schedule generation avoids signed doubling overflow. Prevalidation is
deliberately included in this safe API; the selected probe count excludes that
scan, so it is not the total operation count.

The complete editable C++ programs save figures locally; results contain
ordinary computed Markdown. Selected counters describe actual producer
operations, excluding validation when stated.

